Deep links are wired but unexercisable. Linking.getInitialURL() and the url listener are in native-root.tsx, but no URL scheme is registered in templates/ios/App/Info.plist or the Android manifest — so nothing can deliver one. Written, never run.

Native does not invalidate screens after an action. signOut() redirects to /,
but the /me entry in the profile tab keeps its pre-signout payload, so tapping
the tab shows a stale signed-in screen until a refresh. Web calls
invalidatePayloads() on every command; native has no equivalent.
